---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AssetImage from '../../components/AssetImage.astro';
import { assets } from '../../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Journal"
  description="The New Earth Journal will hold project updates, build notes, research, practical learning and reflections from the journey."
  canonical="/journal/"
>
  <article class="journal-page">
    <header class="shell journal-page__hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">New Earth Journal</p>
        <h1>Journal</h1>
        <p class="lede">A place for project updates, build notes, research, practical learning and reflections from the New Earth journey.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="journal-page__figure">
        <AssetImage asset={assets.journal} alt="An open field notebook with sketches, notes, plant samples and photographs on a wooden table" className="journal-page__visual" loading="eager" />
      </figure>
    </header>

    <section class="section section-sand" aria-labelledby="journal-purpose">
      <div class="shell journal-page__purpose">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Thinking in public</p>
          <h2 id="journal-purpose">A record of questions, work and learning</h2>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p>The Journal will connect New Earth principles with practical experience. It will make room for careful reflection, explain developing ideas and document what projects teach as they move forward.</p>
          <p>Entries will be published when there is something useful and ready to share. The aim is a clear, grounded record rather than an artificial publishing schedule.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="journal-themes">
      <div class="shell">
        <p class="eyebrow">What belongs here</p>
        <h2 id="journal-themes">Themes the Journal will follow</h2>
        <div class="journal-page__themes">
          <article><h3>Project updates</h3><p>Honest progress and current context from practical New Earth work.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Build notes</h3><p>Decisions, experiments and lessons from developing tools and systems.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Research</h3><p>Questions and source-led exploration connected to the wider framework.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Practical learning</h3><p>Useful observations that can help ideas meet everyday life.</p></article>
          <article><h3>Reflections</h3><p>Thoughtful writing from the continuing New Earth journey.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-sand" aria-labelledby="journal-current-state">
      <div class="shell journal-page__state">
        <p class="eyebrow">Current state</p>
        <h2 id="journal-current-state">The first entries are still being prepared</h2>
        <p>No Journal articles are published in this Website V2 baseline. This space will grow as projects, research and practical work are documented and approved for publication.</p>
        <nav class="page-actions" aria-label="Continue exploring New Earth">
          <a class="button" href="/projects/">Explore Projects</a>
          <a class="button" href="/blueprint/">Read the Blueprint</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Contact New Earth</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .journal-page__hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); align-items: center; padding-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem); }
  .journal-page__hero h1 { max-width: none; }
  .journal-page__figure { min-width: 0; margin: 0; }
  .journal-page__figure :global(.journal-page__visual) { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; object-fit: cover; border-radius: var(--radius); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .journal-page__purpose { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .8fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .journal-page__purpose h2, .journal-page__state h2 { max-width: 18ch; }
  .journal-page__purpose p, .journal-page__state > p { max-width: 66ch; }
  .journal-page__themes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .journal-page__themes article { min-width: 0; padding: 1.5rem; border-top: 3px solid var(--teal); background: rgb(255 255 255 / .72); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .journal-page__themes h3 { margin-bottom: .65rem; }
  .journal-page__themes p { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .journal-page__state { max-width: 820px; }
  .journal-page__state .text-link { align-self: center; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .journal-page__hero, .journal-page__purpose { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .journal-page__themes { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); } }
  @media (max-width: 520px) { .journal-page__themes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
